o meet the production requirements to unlock the next upgrades.\u00a0As you progress, you'll grow your island, unlock new technologies, and uncover new resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>no enemies or time limits</strong>, you'll have all the time you need to figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.poster.avif?t=1773061947\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.webm?t=1773061947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/4a8c5b9a333387d6dfc7c8e77c6b96e4.mp4?t=1773061947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Progression System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is tied to your rate of production. Combined with limited resources and not much space, it means that you'll have to figure out dense, efficient factory layouts to produce enough cubes to hit your production targets. Each production target you achieve will be part of future targets as well, meaning that your factory will have to become more and more efficient as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.poster.avif?t=1773061947\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe25ea3bf15acc1c7ce5.webm?t=1773061947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027060/extras/3beab41ce1b0fe